data: {"type": "message", "content": {"type": "ai", "content": "Here are both answers:\n\n**Calculator:** 15/12*7 = **8.75**\n\n**Handbook PTO:** Employees get **15 days of PTO per year, accrued monthly** (AcmeTech_Employee_Handbook.pdf, page 2).\n\nFor context, that page also lists the other leave types: Sick Leave (5 days/year, non-cumulative), Parental Leave (12 weeks paid), and 10 paid public holidays. All leave must be requested in advance through the HR portal except in emergencies.", "tool_calls": [], "tool_call_id": null, "status": null, "run_id": "01a1087e-69bf-74c1-9456-a2f9136215d7", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669", "model_provider": "openai"}, "custom_data": {}}}

